858, "p_value": 1.0059859171028222e-30, "significant": true}], "flags": [{"severity": "warn", "text": "cluster-robust SE is 1.29x the naive i.i.d. SE: outcomes are correlated within clusters \u2014 SUTVA is at risk and the naive p-value overstates precision."}], "segments": [], "details": {"naive_se": 0.2854934104822757, "cluster_se": 0.36773926287006825, "se_ratio": 1.2880831899022012, "n_clusters": 2000}, "trap_reveal": {"what_happened": "Users sit in 2,000 clusters and outcomes spill over onto cluster-mates. The naive i.i.d. SE understates uncertainty by ~1.3\u00d7; the cluster-robust SE is wider and the SUTVA flag fires.", "why_it_matters": "SUTVA violations are invisible to standard tests \u2014 the p-value looks fine while the precision is a lie. On social surfaces, always ask who else the treatment touched."}}]}